  "name": "Shape a Mix with a Three-Band EQ",
  "tool_name": null,
  "description": "Synthesizes a bass line over noise, removes the rumble, then boosts the lows, cuts the harsh mids and adds air before a limiter. Runs locally with no file, model or key.",
